==Trivia==
Tentacool is one of seven Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion featured in the "Touring the Kanto Region" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], in which all of the cards show various elements of the [[Kanto]] region. This card's illustration features [[Vermilion Port]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s|Pokémon FireRed, LeafGreen}}, {{LGPE|Let's Go, Pikachu!, and Let's Go, Eevee!}}.

===Origin===
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

